{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "夜桜さんちの大作戦"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2024年に1期を観ていたのだけど\n今年2期が始まるにあたって\nもう一回見直したいと思って\n最近一気見して…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぴゃーおもしろいおもしろい！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高校生の浅野太陽くんが\n最強スパイ一家・夜桜家に婿入りして、\n大切な人を守るために成長していく\nお話なんだけどね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "戦うシーンはかっこいいし\n家族の空気感は温かいし\n観てると夜桜家のみんなを好きになっちゃうんだー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに推しは 夜桜万さん 🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夜桜家のお家には\nスパイ一家ならではの仕掛けがたくさんあって"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "冷蔵庫を開けるのにも訓練みたいになってたり\n普通の日常なのに全然普通じゃなくて\nずっとわくわくするお話です＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "スパイってなんだか憧れちゃう\nかっちょいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからか最近ね\n自分が夜桜家の一員になった夢を見ました🌃\nちゃんと戦ってたー！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "主題歌は\n櫻坂46の｢What's \"KAZOKU\"？｣です\nぜひたくさん観て聴いてください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "( ੭ ˙˙ )੭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\n15枚目シングルに収録される\nBACKS楽曲｢コインランドリー｣\nミュージックビデオが公開されました🧺🫧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一番はじめのりこちゃんの\nかっこいい歌声が好き( ˆ࿀ˆ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼\n￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobOUxFyx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEhIMgi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobnagW4f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobjA87bV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobPK6U5K.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "むむ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼\n￼\n￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobQ8Z4fU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxH4FfO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobKBOrQK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob3fRVCt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJyF0F2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5SzYd7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "珍しくポニーテールをしてみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n￼\n￼"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpwhPaz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob62OH0S.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobUexIAT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobPtUHrY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "空き時間に駄々をこねる子ども選手権したよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たのしい撮影でした( ᷇ ᵕ ᷆ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この曲を何回も聴いていたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "抱えきれなかった感情も\n時間とともに\n少しずつ輪郭が薄くなっていったなあ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなことを思い出しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰にも言えない気持ちは\n案外みんな持っていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どう扱うかは人それぞれだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "洗濯物と一緒に綺麗にできたらね、\nそんなことできたらね、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんて思いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな世界を想像してみたり( -˘ ̫ -˘)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひたくさん聴いてください〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日はミート＆グリートです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob39R77Q.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5Av55V.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "￼\n待ってるね🧸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も一日おつかれさまだよ〜〜"}], "source": "official"}